  "name": "Pollo Guisado",
  "subtitle": "Tender chicken and potatoes in a savory tomato broth",
  "description": "A one-pot chicken stew simmered with aromatics, sofrito, potatoes, and warm spices, finished with a lightly thickened sauce.",
